:: OC Leo Page Intro [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 15>>
<span style="color:Yellow">Carefully tiptoeing over, not even allowing yourself to breath, you sneak over to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span>’s PC. You know this is risky, a death sentence if discovered, but something inside your little brother body wants to sneak onto <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span>’s computer.</span> You know from the bits you’ve seen that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> doesn’t turn off his computer when he goes to sleep, rather just turns off the monitor. This means that you don’t need his password to log on. <span style="color:LightGreen">The thought of the entire internet being at your fingertips fills you with glee.</span> 

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Smirk",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

You go to sit down on his chair, <span style="color:LightCoral">but it squeaks loudly so you quickly stand back up, worriedly turning to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span>.</span> He stirs a little but doesn’t wake up. That was too close. Guess you’ll be using the computer standing. Carefully, you turn the monitor away from his bed to make sure the light from it doesn’t wake him up then turn it on. <br>
<br>
It flashes on in an instant, showing the interesting background to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span>’s desktop. It appears to be some promotional art from a game or something but doesn’t look like anything you’ve seen before. It seems a little interesting, but not your goal. You quickly ensure the volume is muted and check it again just to be sure before you open up a browser. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span>’s homepage is pretty boring, just a default search engine, and you quickly begin to click and peek around to see what you can find. <br>
<br>
It occurs to you that you have no idea what you are actually looking for. You know you wanted to get on the computer but have no idea what you wanted to look up! Not like you can play a game or download anything, with what little time you have, without <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> noticing. You sigh, clicking <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span>’s bookmarks and begin to curiously glance at them until something catches your eyes. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Shotatube”</span>? Sounds a lot like that video website a lot of people use, <span style="color:Pink">but the icon is a winking drawing of a boy, and it has an 18+ warning on it.</span> And what the heck does Shota mean? Curious, you click on it. <br>
<br>

<<linkreplace"Continue">>
    The website seems to be some sort of streaming and video sight, based on the thumbnails you see. Looks like a lot of people around your or <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span>’s age livestreaming them playing games? <span style="color:Pink">The only weird part is a lot of them are shirtless or are dressed in some strange outfits. You see one that looks to be dressed like a maid and another in some sort of furry animal costume. Weird.</span> <br>
    <br>
   <span style="color:Yellow"> A lot of them are labeled <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Invite Only”</span> or <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Payment Required”</span>.</span> Seems this is some exclusive streaming club for kids? Weird. Who would pay to watch a kid play a video game? You can do that for free by taking Noah to the arcade. You’ll never understand internet people. <br>
    <br>
    You continue to scroll through until you finally find one that isn’t behind a paywall of some sort. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Leo P</span>. Speedo Night Challenge!”</span> <span style="color:Pink">Speedo night?</span> You lean in closer and examine the thumbnail. <span style="color:Pink">You blush instantly. This doesn’t look like some kid playing video games or something like that. Instead, the thumbnail is of a boy about your age who is a little chubby wearing nothing but a very tight speedo and sunglasses! His legs are up, revealing a lot more than you’d imagine would be allowed! The thumbnail isn’t very big, but it looks like the kid is packing. How on earth is this legal!?</span>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Blush: 1,                
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

    Gulping and taking a deep breath, you click the video. <br>
    <br>
    <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hey chat, figured I’d do a speedo-”</span> <span style="color:LightCoral">The voice comes out of the speakers and you instantly jump. It’s not super loud, but loud enough in the silent house to easily be heard! You panic, trying to close the window as you hear <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> stirring in the bed nearby.</span> You fumble a few times, clicking wildly and accidentally hitting the bookmark button before you finally hit close right as the kid in the video mentions that he’ll be doing a challenge run and, if he loses, he’ll be posting this up for free and losing the speedo. <br>
    <br>
    You’d blush and watch more, <span style="color:LightCoral">but you suddenly hear <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> begin to groan and move about. It’s too risky to stay! You quickly shut the monitor off and sprint out of the room as fast as you can, diving headfirst under your blankets to pretend to be asleep.</span> <br>
    <br>
    You stay there for a while, too scared to move. You hear someone stepping out in the hallway. <span style="color:LightCoral">This is it! You’re done for! <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span>’s going to beat your ass so hard you won’t be able to ever sit again!</span> You await your fate… then hear the bathroom door open? You hear <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> go inside, do his business, before returning to his room. <span style="color:LightGreen">Did… did you really get away with it?</span> <br>
    <br>
    Once you are sure <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> is gone, you let out a sigh of relief. That was too close. You can’t risk that again! You swear you muted his computer, but maybe you didn’t do it right? Dang it. <span style="color:Pink">That video though… he said if he lost the challenge he would post it for free and lose the speedo… and you saw it for free…</span> <br>
    <br>
    You feel your face light up. What was that site!? Whatever it was, you need to see it again. But how are you going to do that without being spotted? You think for a second. <span style="color:Yellow">You wonder if you’d be able to sneak onto <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span>’s computer while he’s at school. Maybe you’ll get lucky and he won’t turn it off? It’s risky, but it may be worth it if you could see more of that video, even if it means missing first period.</span> <br>
    <<set $InActiveQuests.delete("Leo: Shotatube Show")>>
    <<set $ActiveQuests.push("Leo: Shotatube Show")>>
